<Window x:Class="BridgeSystems.Bridgemate.DataConnectorClientEmulator.MainWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
        xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
        xmlns:local="clr-namespace:BridgeSystems.Bridgemate.DataConnectorClientEmulator"
        xmlns:vm="clr-namespace:BridgeSystems.Bridgemate.DataConnectorClientEmulator.Viewmodels"
        xmlns:controls="clr-namespace:BridgeSystems.Bridgemate.DataConnectorClientEmulator.Controls"
        mc:Ignorable="d"
        Title="MainWindow" Height="700" Width="1280"
        >
    <Window.Background>
        <SolidColorBrush Color="LightGreen"/>
    </Window.Background>
    <Window.DataContext>
        <vm:MainViewmodel />
    </Window.DataContext>
    <Grid>
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition/>
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1">
            <TabControl Grid.Row="1" ScrollViewer.CanContentScroll="True">
                <TabItem Header="Information">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource LabellikeTextblockStyle}">
                    This application can be used to see how sending and receiving data to the Bridgemate Data Connector works, using the BridgeSystems.Bridgemate.DataConnector.ScoringProgramClient.dll.
                        <LineBreak/>
                    This dll contains the ScoringProgramDataConnectorPipeClient class that can be used to connect and exchange data.
                    All buttons have a tooltip explaining to which command it is bound in the viewmodel. In this way you can seee how the DTOs are constructed and which API call is made with it.
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock>
                    <Bold>To get started:</Bold>T<LineBreak/>
                        Select the "Connect" tab and connect to the data connector. <LineBreak/>
                        Check that the red cross changes in a green tick. Check the "Ping" command.<LineBreak/>
                        After that select one of the other tabs to test basic to advanced features.<LineBreak/>
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock><LineBreak/></TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock>
                        <Bold>Launch data connector console</Bold><LineBreak/>
                        The data connector will run in the background after logging on to the Windows account.<LineBreak/>
                        To restart the data connector with a console window press the button below.<LineBreak/>
                        Mind that when closing the console window the data connector is truly shut down. Communication with it will fail. <LineBreak/>
                        If BCS 5 is running, however, this will restart the data connector after a ten seconds.<LineBreak/>
                        Executing the "Connect" command will restart the data connector as well, but without a console window.
                        </TextBlock>
                        <Button Command="{Binding LaunchVisibleDataConnectorCommand}" Content="Restart the data connector"
                                ToolTip="{Binding LaunchVisibleDataConnectorCommandDescription}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                </TabItem>
                <TabItem Header="Connect" >
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.Background>
                            <SolidColorBrush Color="LightGray" Opacity=".2"/>
                        </Grid.Background>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <CheckBox Content="Use http" IsChecked="{Binding UseHttp}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="4,2"
                                      ToolTip="When unchecked the emulator communicates over named pipes (same computer only). Http also works from another computer on the local network."/>
                            <TextBlock Text="Base address:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,2,2,2"/>
                            <TextBox Text="{Binding HttpBaseAddress, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" MinWidth="180" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                     IsEnabled="{Binding UseHttp}"
                                     ToolTip="The address of the computer the data connector runs on, e.g. http://192.168.1.50:5079. Leave empty for the data connector on this computer."/>
                            <TextBlock Text="ClubId:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,2,2,2"/>
                            <TextBox Text="{Binding HttpClubId, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" MinWidth="100" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                     IsEnabled="{Binding UseHttp}"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="LicenceKey:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,2,2,2"/>
                            <TextBox Text="{Binding HttpLicenceKey, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" MinWidth="100" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                     IsEnabled="{Binding UseHttp}"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <Image Source="Images/tick.ico" Height="40" Width="40"
                               Visibility="{Binding IsConnected,Converter={StaticResource BVP}}"/>
                            <Image  Source="Images/cross.ico" Height="40" Width="40"
                                Visibility="{Binding IsConnected, Converter={StaticResource BVP},
                                      ConverterParameter=inverted}"/>
                            <Button Content="Connect" Command="{Binding ConnectCommand}" Width="100"
                                    ToolTip="{Binding ConnectCommandDescription}"/>
                            <Button Content="Ping" Command="{Binding PingCommand}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}"  Width="100"
                                    ToolTip="{Binding PingCommandDescription}"/>
                            <Button Content="Disconnect" Command="{Binding DisconnectCommand}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}"  Width="100"
                                    ToolTip="{Binding DisconnectCommandDescription}"/>
                            <Button Content="Shut down BCS" Command="{Binding ShutdownBCSCommand}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}" Width="100"
                                    ToolTip="{Binding ShutdownBCSCommandDescription}"/>
                            <Button Command="{Binding ClearDataCommand}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}"  Width="100" 
                                FontWeight="Bold" ToolTip="{Binding ClearDataCommandDescription}">
                                <Button.Foreground>
                                    <SolidColorBrush Color="Red" Opacity="{Binding IsConnected, Converter={StaticResource BOC}}"/>
                                </Button.Foreground>
                                <Button.Background>
                                    <SolidColorBrush Color="Orange" Opacity=".3"/>
                                </Button.Background>
                                <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="Clear all data connector data"/>
                            </Button>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <Border Grid.Row="2" BorderBrush="DarkSlateGray" BorderThickness="1" Padding="4" Margin="10,2">
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding ConfigStatusMessage}"/>
                        </Border>
                        <Grid Grid.Row="3">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <Button Grid.Column="0" Content="Get BCS status" Command="{Binding GetStatusInfoCommand}"
                                    VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}"
                                    ToolTip="{Binding GetStatusInfoCommandDescription}"/>
                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="1">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                    <TextBlock Text="Is running:" Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding StatusInfo.IsRunning}" Margin="2,8,2,2"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Event guid:" MinWidth="15" Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding StatusInfo.EventGuid}" Margin="2,8,2,2"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                    <TextBlock Text="Scoring file at:" Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding StatusInfo.ScoringFilePath}" Margin="2,8,2,2"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                    <TextBlock Text="Data connector file at:" Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding StatusInfo.DataConnectorFilePath}" Margin="2,8,2,2"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <GroupBox Header="Current Sessions" Width="350" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                                    <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding StatusInfo.SessionInformation}"
                                                  Margin="2"
                                                  Padding="0">
                                        <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                            <DataTemplate>
                                                <Border BorderThickness="1" BorderBrush="LightSlateGray" Padding="2" Margin="1">
                                                    <Grid>
                                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition/>
                                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Grid.Row="0" Text="Session guid:"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Text="{Binding SessionGuid}"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Grid.Row="1" Text="Name:"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="1" Text="{Binding SessionName}"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Grid.Row="2" Text="Date/time:"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="2" Text="{Binding SessionDateTime}"/>
                                                    </Grid>
                                                </Border>
                                            </DataTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl>
                                </GroupBox>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>
                        <Grid Grid.Row="4">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <Button Grid.Column="0" Content="Get all sessions" Command="{Binding GetAllSessionsInfoCommand}"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                    ToolTip="{Binding GetAllSessionsInfoCommandDescription}"/>
                            <GroupBox Grid.Column="1" Header="All sessions known to BCS 5">
                                <ScrollViewer>
                                    <DataGrid ItemsSource="{Binding AllSessionsInfo.SessionInformation}"
                                                  IsReadOnly="True" AutoGenerateColumns="False">
                                        <DataGrid.Columns>
                                            <DataGridTextColumn Header="Name" Binding="{Binding SessionName}"/>
                                            <DataGridTextColumn Header="Date/Time" Binding="{Binding SessionDateTime}"/>
                                            <DataGridTextColumn Header="Event guid" Binding="{Binding EventGuid}"/>
                                            <DataGridTextColumn Header="Session guid" Binding="{Binding SessionGuid}"/>
                                            <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="Sections">
                                                <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                                    <DataTemplate>
                                                        <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Sections}" Margin="0">
                                                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                                <DataTemplate>
                                                                    <Grid>
                                                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                                            <ColumnDefinition />
                                                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Letters:"/>
                                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding SectionLetters}"/>
                                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="Tables:"/>
                                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="3" Text="{Binding NumberOfTables}"/>
                                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Text="Name:"/>
                                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="5" Text="{Binding SectionName}"/>
                                                                    </Grid>
                                                                </DataTemplate>
                                                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                        </ItemsControl>
                                                    </DataTemplate>
                                                </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                                            </DataGridTemplateColumn>
                                        </DataGrid.Columns>
                                    </DataGrid>
                                </ScrollViewer>
                            </GroupBox>
                        </Grid>
                    </Grid>
                </TabItem>
                <TabItem Header="Basic event procedures" IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}">
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource LabellikeTextblockStyle}" Grid.Row="0">
                        On this tab you can initialize a session, send and update player names. As data the serialized InitDTOs and ResultDTOs
                        included in this project will be used.
                        </TextBlock>
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Grid.Row="1">
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource LabellikeTextblockStyle}" Text="Current event:"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding CurrentEventGuid}"/>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource LabellikeTextblockStyle}" Text="Current session:"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding CurrentEvent.CurrentSession.SessionGuid}"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding CurrentEvent.CurrentSession.Name}"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <Grid Grid.Row="2">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="3*"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="2*"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0">
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                                Launch BCS with a session for four anonymous pairs, playing three rounds on two tables. 
                                Handrecords are not included.All previous data for this session will be erased and the Bridgemates will
                                be reinitialized to round one.
                                </TextBlock>
                                <Button Content="Launch BCS" Command="{Binding LaunchCommand}"
                                IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}"/>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                            Relaunches BCS for the current session.All previous data for this session will be 
                            retained and the Bridgemates will
                            not be touched..
                                </TextBlock>
                                <Button Content="Continue BCS" Command="{Binding ContinueCommand}"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}"/>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">     
                            Sends a result of 1 Club made for board one on table one in the first round. Lead is Ace of Clubs.
                                </TextBlock>
                                <Button Content="Send result" Command="{Binding SendResultCommand}"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}"/>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                                Update the name of a player.
                                </TextBlock>
                                <controls:PlayerNameControl/>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <Grid Grid.Column="1">
                                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                    <RowDefinition/>
                                </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                                Communication results
                                </TextBlock>
                                <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1" x:Name="svComResults">
                                    <ItemsControl Margin="4" ItemsSource="{Binding CommunicationResults}"
                                              x:Name="icComResults">
                                        <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                            <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                                <Setter Property="Margin" Value="1"/>
                                            </Style>
                                        </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                            <DataTemplate>
                                                <StackPanel>
                                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                        <TextBlock Text="Request: "/>
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding RequestDescription}"/>
                                                    </StackPanel>
                                                    <Grid>
                                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition/>
                                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Message:"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding ResponseMessage}" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                                                    </Grid>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                            </DataTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl>
                                </ScrollViewer>
                            </Grid>
                        </Grid>
                    </Grid>
                </TabItem>
                <TabItem Header="Advanced event procedures" IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}">
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource LabellikeTextblockStyle}" Grid.Row="0">
                    On this tab you can initialize a session with partly preconfigured player names and all handrecords, 
                    send a result and poll for data from the dataconnector. As data the serialized InitDTOs and ResultDTOs
                    included in this project can be used or DTOs from other sources can be selected to test their behaviour.
                    Moreover, extra player names, all having the surname "Narnia" and a player number starting with "990" are present,
                    enabling you to register known players on the Bridgemates. 
                    On the Bridgemate III it is also possible to register as a new player.
                        </TextBlock>
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Grid.Row="1">
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource LabellikeTextblockStyle}" Text="Current event:"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding CurrentEventGuid}"/>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource LabellikeTextblockStyle}" Text="Current session:"/>

                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding CurrentEvent.CurrentSession.SessionGuid}"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding CurrentEvent.CurrentSession.Name}"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <Grid Grid.Row="2">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="3*"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="2*"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0">
                                <Expander Header="Launch and continue Bridgemates" 
                                      IsExpanded="{Binding EventHasLaunched ,Converter={StaticResource Not}}">
                                    <StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                                    Launch BCS with a session with two sections of 6 tables and 8 pairs for each section, playing six rounds. 
                                    Handrecords are included. All player names are configured for section A, partly for section B. 
                                    Not all preregistered players have a player number. BCS will then generate a number starting with '*', based on the position on the starting table.
                                    All previous data for this session will be erased and the Bridgemates will
                                    be reinitialized to round one.
                                    Alternatively, select a file containing a serialized InitDTO.
                                        </TextBlock>
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                            <Button Content="Launch BCS" Command="{Binding LaunchAdvancedCommand}"
                                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" 
                                                    ToolTip="{Binding LaunchAdvancedCommandDescription}"/>
                                            <Button Content="Select InitDto and Launch" Command="{Binding LaunchSelectedInitDtoCommand}"
                                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                                    ToolTip="{Binding LaunchSelectedInitDtoCommandDescription}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                                    Relaunches BCS for the current session.All previous data for this session will be 
                                    retained and the Bridgemates will
                                    not be touched.
                                        </TextBlock>
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                            <Button Content="Continue BCS" Command="{Binding ContinueCommand}"
                                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                    ToolTip="{Binding ContinueCommandDescription}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Expander>
                                <Expander Header="Send results" IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}">
                                    <controls:ResultsControl/>
                                </Expander>
                                <Expander Header="Update the name of a player." IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}">
                                    <controls:PlayerNameControl/>
                                </Expander>
                                <Expander Header="Send td call status update" IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}">
                                    <StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                                            Send a TdCallDTO with the values below as a status update for a td call to the data connector.
                                        </TextBlock>
                                        <Grid Margin="2">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition/>
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Section:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                            <ComboBox Grid.Column="1" ItemsSource="{Binding Sections}"
                                                      SelectedItem="{Binding TdCallSection}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="Table:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                            <ComboBox Grid.Column="3" ItemsSource="{Binding TableNumbers}"
                                                      SelectedItem="{Binding TdCallTableNumber}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Text="Round:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                            <ComboBox Grid.Column="5" ItemsSource="{Binding ContractRounds}"
                                                      SelectedItem="{Binding TdCallRoundNumber}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="6" Text="Hour:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                            <TextBox Grid.Column="7" Text="{Binding TdCallHour}" Margin="2" MinWidth="40"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="8" Text="Minute:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                            <TextBox Grid.Column="9" Text="{Binding TdCallMinute}" Margin="2" MinWidth="40"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="10" Text="Status:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                            <ComboBox Grid.Column="11" ItemsSource="{Binding TdCallStatusValues}"
                                                      SelectedItem="{Binding TdCallStatus}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                        <Button Content="Send td call" Command="{Binding SendTdCallCommand}"
                                                HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="2"
                                                ToolTip="{Binding SendTdCallCommandDescription}"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding TdCallValidationMessage}" Foreground="Red" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="2"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Expander>
                                <Expander Header="Polling" IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}">
                                    <controls:PollingControl/>
                                </Expander>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <Grid Grid.Column="1">
                                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                    <RowDefinition/>
                                </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                                Communication results
                                </TextBlock>
                                <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1" x:Name="svComResultsAdvanced">
                                    <ItemsControl Margin="4" ItemsSource="{Binding CommunicationResults}"
                                   x:Name="icComResultsAdvanced">
                                        <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                            <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                                <Setter Property="Margin" Value="1"/>
                                            </Style>
                                        </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                            <DataTemplate>
                                                <StackPanel>
                                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                        <TextBlock Text="Request: "/>
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding RequestDescription}"/>
                                                    </StackPanel>
                                                    <Grid>
                                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition/>
                                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Message: "
                                                               FontFamily="Consolas"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding ResponseMessage}" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                               FontFamily="Consolas">
                                                            <TextBlock.Foreground>
                                                                <SolidColorBrush Color="{Binding ErrorType,Converter={StaticResource ECC}}"/>
                                                            </TextBlock.Foreground>
                                                        </TextBlock>
                                                    </Grid>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                            </DataTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl>
                                </ScrollViewer>
                            </Grid>
                        </Grid>
                    </Grid>
                </TabItem>
                <TabItem Header="Manual event creation" IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}">
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="3*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="2*"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Grid.ColumnSpan="2" 
                               Style="{StaticResource LabellikeTextblockStyle}">
                        On this tab it is possible to generate new events and change their movements by adding and removing pairs for a section, 
                        or by adding or removing entire sections.
                        All movements are based on the Mitchell algorithm.
                        </TextBlock>
                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0">
                            <GroupBox Header="Event">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}" Text="Event guid:"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding CurrentEvent.EventGuid}" Margin="2,5,2,2"/>
                                        <Button Command="{Binding LaunchCreatedEventCommand}" Content="Launch event" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="14"
                                            IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched,Converter={StaticResource Not}}"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding AllSectionDesriptions,StringFormat=Launch with sections: {0}.}">
                                            <TextBlock.Foreground>
                                                <SolidColorBrush Color="Black" 
                                                             Opacity="{Binding EventHasLaunched, 
                                                                               Converter={StaticResource BOC},
                                                                               ConverterParameter=inverted}"/>
                                            </TextBlock.Foreground>
                                        </TextBlock>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <ScrollViewer Visibility="{Binding HasValidationMessages,
                                    Converter={StaticResource BVP},
                                    ConverterParameter=collapse}">
                                        <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding ValidationMessages}"
                                              Foreground="Red">
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                <DataTemplate>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding}" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                                                </DataTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl>
                                    </ScrollViewer>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </GroupBox>
                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}" Text="Current session:"/>
                                <TextBlock Margin="2,5,2,2" Text="{Binding CurrentEvent.CurrentSession.Name}"/>
                                <TextBlock Margin="2,5,2,2" Text="{Binding CurrentEvent.CurrentSession.SessionGuid}"/>
                                <Button Margin="8,2" Command="{Binding AddSessionCommand}" Content="Add session"
                                        ToolTip="{Binding AddSessionCommandDescription}"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TabControl ItemsSource="{Binding CurrentEvent.Sessions}" SelectedItem="{Binding CurrentEvent.CurrentSession}"
                                        x:Name="tcSessionCreation">
                                    <TabControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding SessionGuid}"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </TabControl.ItemTemplate>
                                    <TabControl.ContentTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Expander Header="Manage sections" IsExpanded="{Binding HasLaunched,Converter={StaticResource Not}}">
                                                <controls:SessionCreationControl/>
                                            </Expander>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </TabControl.ContentTemplate>
                                </TabControl>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <Expander Header="Change movements" IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Update section:"/>
                                        <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding UpdatableSections}"
                                              SelectedItem="{Binding SelectedUpdatableSection}"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <Button Command="{Binding AddTwoPairsCommand}" ToolTip="{Binding AddTwoPairsCommandDescription}">
                                            <Button.Content>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding SelectedUpdatableSection,StringFormat=Add two pairs to section {0}}"/>
                                            </Button.Content>
                                        </Button>
                                        <Button Command="{Binding RemoveTwoPairsCommand}" MaxWidth="250" ToolTip="{Binding RemoveTwoPairsCommandDescription}">
                                            <Button.Content>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding SelectedUpdatableSection,StringFormat=Remove two pairs from section {0}}"/>
                                            </Button.Content>
                                        </Button>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <Button Command="{Binding DeleteSectionCommand}" ToolTip="{Binding DeleteSectionCommandDescription}">
                                            <Button.Content>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding SelectedUpdatableSection,StringFormat=Delete section {0}}"
                                                       Foreground="Red" FontWeight="Bold"/>
                                            </Button.Content>
                                        </Button>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Expander>
                            <Expander Header="Send results" IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}">
                                <controls:ResultsControl/>
                            </Expander>
                            <Expander Header="player management." IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <Button Command="{Binding ImportPlayerDataCommand}" Content="Import and send player data"
                                            ToolTip="{Binding ImportPlayerDataCommandDescription}"/>
                                    <controls:PlayerNameControl/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Expander>
                            <Expander Header="Send td call status update" IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                                        Send a TdCallDTO with the values below as a status update for a td call to the data connector.
                                    </TextBlock>
                                    <Grid Margin="2">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Section:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <ComboBox Grid.Column="1" ItemsSource="{Binding Sections}"
                                                  SelectedItem="{Binding TdCallSection}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="Table:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <ComboBox Grid.Column="3" ItemsSource="{Binding TableNumbers}"
                                                  SelectedItem="{Binding TdCallTableNumber}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Text="Round:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <ComboBox Grid.Column="5" ItemsSource="{Binding ContractRounds}"
                                                  SelectedItem="{Binding TdCallRoundNumber}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="6" Text="Hour:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <TextBox Grid.Column="7" Text="{Binding TdCallHour}" Margin="2" MinWidth="40"/>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="8" Text="Minute:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <TextBox Grid.Column="9" Text="{Binding TdCallMinute}" Margin="2" MinWidth="40"/>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="10" Text="Status:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <ComboBox Grid.Column="11" ItemsSource="{Binding TdCallStatusValues}"
                                                  SelectedItem="{Binding TdCallStatus}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                    <Button Content="Send td call" Command="{Binding SendTdCallCommand}"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="2"
                                            ToolTip="{Binding SendTdCallCommandDescription}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding TdCallValidationMessage}" Foreground="Red" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="2"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Expander>
                            <Expander Header="Polling" IsEnabled="{Binding EventHasLaunched}">
                                <controls:PollingControl/>
                            </Expander>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <Grid Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1">
                            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                <RowDefinition/>
                            </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                        Communication results
                            </TextBlock>
                            <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1" x:Name="svComResultsManual">
                                <ItemsControl Margin="4" ItemsSource="{Binding CommunicationResults}"
                                          x:Name="icComResultsManual">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="1"/>
                                        </Style>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <StackPanel>
                                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="Request: "/>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding RequestDescription}"/>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                                <Grid>
                                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition/>
                                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Message: "
                                                           FontFamily="Consolas"/>
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding ResponseMessage}" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                           FontFamily="Consolas">
                                                        <TextBlock.Foreground>
                                                            <SolidColorBrush Color="{Binding ErrorType,Converter={StaticResource ECC}}"/>
                                                        </TextBlock.Foreground>
                                                    </TextBlock>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>
                            </ScrollViewer>
                        </Grid>
                    </Grid>
                </TabItem>
                <TabItem Header="Swiss Pairs" IsEnabled="{Binding IsConnected}">
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="3*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="2*"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Grid.ColumnSpan="2"
                               Style="{StaticResource LabellikeTextblockStyle}">
                        Creates a single-section, single-scoring-group session and pushes its rounds one at a time, using
                        KeepBridgematesAlive so the Bridgemate servers keep waiting for the next round instead of closing
                        the session - the way a Swiss-match scoring program would. The movement itself is a plain
                        barometer Mitchell movement (every table plays the same board group each round); once its
                        natural round limit is reached, pairings wrap around and repeat.
                        </TextBlock>
                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0">
                            <GroupBox Header="Create session" IsEnabled="{Binding SwissPairs.HasLaunched,Converter={StaticResource Not}}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Session name:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <TextBox Text="{Binding SwissPairs.SessionName}" Margin="2" MinWidth="150"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Number of tables:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <TextBox Text="{Binding SwissPairs.NumberOfTables}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Number of winners:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding SwissPairs.NumberOfWinnersOptions}"
                                              SelectedItem="{Binding SwissPairs.SelectedNumberOfWinners}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Number of boards per round:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <TextBox Text="{Binding SwissPairs.NumberOfBoardsPerRound}" Margin="2" MinWidth="50"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <Button Command="{Binding SwissPairs.LaunchCommand}" Content="Launch" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="14"
                                        HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="2"
                                        ToolTip="{Binding SwissPairs.LaunchCommandDescription}"/>
                                    <ScrollViewer Visibility="{Binding SwissPairs.HasValidationMessages,
                                    Converter={StaticResource BVP},
                                    ConverterParameter=collapse}">
                                        <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding SwissPairs.ValidationMessages}"
                                              Foreground="Red">
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                <DataTemplate>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding}" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                                                </DataTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl>
                                    </ScrollViewer>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </GroupBox>
                            <GroupBox Header="Push rounds" IsEnabled="{Binding SwissPairs.HasLaunched}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Current round:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding SwissPairs.CurrentRoundNumber}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="Mitchell round limit:" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="10,2,2,2"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding SwissPairs.MaxRounds}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <Button Command="{Binding SwissPairs.PushNextRoundCommand}" Content="Push next ongoing round"
                                            Margin="2" ToolTip="{Binding SwissPairs.PushNextRoundCommandDescription}"/>
                                        <Button Command="{Binding SwissPairs.PushLastRoundCommand}" Content="Push last round"
                                            Margin="2" ToolTip="{Binding SwissPairs.PushLastRoundCommandDescription}"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </GroupBox>
                            <GroupBox Header="Poll results" IsEnabled="{Binding SwissPairs.HasLaunched}">
                                <controls:PollingControl/>
                            </GroupBox>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <Grid Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1">
                            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                <RowDefinition/>
                            </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Style="{StaticResource HeaderTextblockStyle}">
                        Communication results
                            </TextBlock>
                            <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1" x:Name="svComResultsSwiss">
                                <ItemsControl Margin="4" ItemsSource="{Binding CommunicationResults}"
                                          x:Name="icComResultsSwiss">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="1"/>
                                        </Style>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <StackPanel>
                                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="Request: "/>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding RequestDescription}"/>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                                <Grid>
                                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition/>
                                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Message: "
                                                           FontFamily="Consolas"/>
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding ResponseMessage}" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                           FontFamily="Consolas">
                                                        <TextBlock.Foreground>
                                                            <SolidColorBrush Color="{Binding ErrorType,Converter={StaticResource ECC}}"/>
                                                        </TextBlock.Foreground>
                                                    </TextBlock>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>
                            </ScrollViewer>
                        </Grid>
                    </Grid>
                </TabItem>
                <TabItem Header="How to use manual event creation">
                    <FlowDocumentScrollViewer>
                        <FlowDocument>
                            <FlowDocument.Resources>
                                <Style TargetType="Paragraph" x:Key="H2HeaderStyle">
                                    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Bold"/>
                                    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="16"/>
                                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="2,8,2,2"/>
                                </Style>
                                <Style TargetType="Paragraph" x:Key="H3HeaderStyle">
                                    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Bold"/>
                                    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="15"/>
                                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="6,6,2,2"/>
                                </Style>
                                <Style TargetType="Paragraph" x:Key="H4HeaderStyle">
                                    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Bold"/>
                                    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="14"/>
                                    <Setter Property="FontStyle" Value="Italic"/>
                                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="10,4,2,2"/>
                                </Style>
                                <Style TargetType="List">
                                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="12,2"/>
                                    <Setter Property="MarkerStyle" Value="Disc"/>
                                </Style>
                                <Style TargetType="ListItem">
                                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="2"/>
                                    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
                                </Style>
                                <Style TargetType="Section">
                                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="2,2,2,8"/>
                                </Style>
                            </FlowDocument.Resources>
                            <Section x:Name="scTop">
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H2HeaderStyle}">
                                    On this page several procedures are explained that can be excuted on the "Manual event creation tab.
                                </Paragraph>
                            </Section>
                            <Paragraph>
                                <Hyperlink x:Name="hlCreate" Click="hlCreate_Click">Procedures to create an event</Hyperlink>
                            </Paragraph>
                            <Paragraph>
                                <Hyperlink x:Name="hlModify" Click="hlModify_Click">Procedures to modify the event after launch</Hyperlink>
                            </Paragraph>
                            <Paragraph>
                                <Hyperlink x:Name="hlSendAndPoll" Click="hlSendAndPoll_Click">Sending and polling data</Hyperlink>
                            </Paragraph>
                            <Section x:Name="scCreate">
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H3HeaderStyle}">
                                    Procedures to create an event
                                </Paragraph>
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H4HeaderStyle}">
                                    Launch the event.
                                </Paragraph>
                                <List>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            The event can be launced by clicking the "Launch event" button. The event must have at least one section.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            After the event has been launched data can be sent to it or polled from it.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            Mind that it is not required that BCS is really started after launching the event. The data connector will hold on to the data until BCS requests it. If BCS is indeed running can be checked on the "Connection" tab.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            A note on terminology:
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            An
                                            <Bold>event</Bold> will be run by BCS that contains at least one
                                            <Bold>session.</Bold> A session contains at least one
                                            <Bold>scoringgroup.</Bold> A scoringgroup contains at least one
                                            <Bold>section.</Bold>
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            BCS will calculate the result for each pair within its scoringgroup.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            Currently, moving of pairs between sections within a scoringgroup is not supported.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                </List>
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H4HeaderStyle}">
                                    Add sections to the current session
                                </Paragraph>
                                <List>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            In the "Session properties" area the currently selected session is shown, together with its scoringroups.
                                        At program startup an event with one session is created automatically. It is possible to add more sessions, both before and after launch of the event.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            On the "Section properties" area set the desired properties for the section.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            On the "Movement proerties set the desired properties for movement generation.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            The movement generation is based on the Mitchell algorithm, so the maximum number of rounds is equal to the number of tables for an odd number of tables and there is one round less for an even number of tables.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            After setting the desired properties click either the button to create a two winner secion or the button to create a onw winner section.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            <Bold>Note:</Bold> For a one winner section consecutive numbering is always applied.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            As long as the event has not been launched you can change the properties for the section in the appropriate areas and click the desired button again. Likewise, more than one section can be added.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            Scoringgroups will be created automatically.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            The sections can be reset by clicking the "Reset sections" button.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                </List>
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H4HeaderStyle}">
                                    Add a session
                                </Paragraph>
                                <List>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            By clicking the "Add session" button a session can be added to the event both before and after launching it.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            Add at least one section to it and make sure that is has sectionletters and a scoringgroupnumber that are not in use in the other session or sessions.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                </List>
                                <Paragraph>
                                    <Hyperlink Click="HyperlinkBack_Click">Back to top</Hyperlink>
                                </Paragraph>
                            </Section>
                            <Section x:Name="scModify">
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H3HeaderStyle}">
                                    Procedures to modify the event after launch
                                </Paragraph>
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H4HeaderStyle}">
                                    Modifying a section
                                </Paragraph>
                                <List>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            The movement of a section can be changed by adjusting the section and movement properties. The letters cannot be changed.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            Click on the "Add one winner section" or "Add two winner section" button to prepare the section for modification.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            Click the "Send updated section(s)" button to send the modified sections to the data connector.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            The modified sections will be sent, one by one, as a SectionUpdateDTO to the data connector. It is not necessary to specify which changes are needed. The data connector will compare the existing movement of the section to the updated one and act accordingly.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            The data connector will send back a SectionUpdateDTO that contains the seatings that were changed if the update was valid.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                </List>
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H4HeaderStyle}">
                                    Adding a section
                                </Paragraph>
                                <List>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            Add a section to the currently selected session by choosing a sectionletter that is not yet in use. The section will be prepared for addition to the session.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            Click the "Send updated section(s)" button to send the added sections to the data connector.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                </List>
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H4HeaderStyle}">
                                    Delete a section
                                </Paragraph>
                                <List>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            A secetion can be deleted by selecting its letter in the Section properties area and clicking the "Delete section" button.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            An SectionUpdateDTO specifying that the section should be deleted will be sent immediately to the data connector.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                </List>
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H4HeaderStyle}">
                                    Adding a session
                                </Paragraph>
                                <List>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            Prepare a session to be added to the launched event by clicking the "Add session" button. A new tab will be created to manage the new session's sections.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            Add at least one section and click one of the buttons to add it.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            Click the "Send added session" button to send it to the data connector.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            An AddSessionDTO will be created that will be sent to the data connector. New player data and participations can be added to it (Currently not implemented in this emulator).
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                </List>
                                <Paragraph>
                                    <Hyperlink Click="HyperlinkBack_Click">Back to top</Hyperlink>
                                </Paragraph>
                            </Section>
                            <Section x:Name="scSendAndPoll">
                                <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H3HeaderStyle}">
                                    Sending and polling data
                                </Paragraph>
                                <List>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            Sending data and polling for data should speak for itself. The controls to do this are deliberately designed as to allow the sending of invalid data in order to teach how to send correct data.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            <Bold>Note:</Bold>
                                            Sending participations is only possible by sending the player number. A PlayerDataDTO containing the playernumber and name of the player has to be sent to the dataconnector previous to sending the participation.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                    <ListItem>
                                        <Paragraph>
                                            Player data can be generated at the "player management" area, or it can be imported by clicking the "Import and send playerdata" button.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            This will try to import player data from a .csv file. Its structure must be:
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            <Italic>first name,last name, player number</Italic>
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            <Italic>first name,last name, player number</Italic>
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            <Italic>first name,last name, player number</Italic>
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            <Bold>Note:</Bold> The player number field must bot be empty.
                                            <LineBreak/>
                                            <Bold>Note:</Bold> Player data must be sent for each <Italic>session</Italic>.
                                        </Paragraph>
                                    </ListItem>
                                </List>
                                <Paragraph>
                                    <Hyperlink Click="HyperlinkBack_Click">Back to top</Hyperlink>
                                </Paragraph>
                            </Section>
                        </FlowDocument>
                    </FlowDocumentScrollViewer>
                </TabItem>
            </TabControl>
        </ScrollViewer>
    </Grid>
</Window>
